32
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:03,390
Episode 22:
The Decisive Extra Time

33
00:01:58,380 --> 00:02:03,390
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

34
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,050
Let's go, Musashi!

35
00:02:02,050 --> 00:02:03,680
Come on, Nankatsu!

36
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:07,370
Nankatsu is trying to find an opening in the defense by passing.

37
00:02:07,370 --> 00:02:10,980
However, with even Musashi's forwards back, everyone is on defense!

38
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:15,110
There's no doubt they're trying to protect this one-goal lead.

39
00:02:15,110 --> 00:02:18,610
Honma, Sanada! Keep marking Tsubasa-kun like this!

40
00:02:18,610 --> 00:02:19,200
What?!

41
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:22,830
At this rate, Nankatsu will have no one to rely on but Tsubasa-kun!

42
00:02:22,830 --> 00:02:26,580
Don't think about the ball! Just tightly mark Tsubasa-kun!

43
00:02:26,580 --> 00:02:27,120
Okay!

44
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,000
What?!

45
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,640
What's wrong, kids?!

46
00:02:29,640 --> 00:02:32,040
It's obvious they're going to tightly mark Tsubasa!

47
00:02:32,740 --> 00:02:37,420
But Nankatsu didn't get this far by winning only thanks to Tsubasa!

48
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:41,470
At this crucial moment, everyone must combine their strength and get that goal!

49
00:02:41,470 --> 00:02:43,250
Wakabayashi-san...

50
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:43,760
Alright!

51
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:47,100
As the Shutetsu Trio, we'll tear through their defense!

52
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:47,640
Yes!

53
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:50,140
Ichinose! Mukai! Go left and mark those two!

54
00:02:51,010 --> 00:02:51,850
What?!

55
00:02:51,850 --> 00:02:53,560
If it doesn't work from this side...

56
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,560
He'll pass to the right!

57
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,730
Nakajima, mark him!

58
00:02:56,730 --> 00:02:57,480
Okay!

59
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:02,030
There's nowhere for Kisugi-kun to pass.

60
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:03,280
No way.

61
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:06,450
Misugi-kun is reading all of our movements.

62
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:10,280
He's so calm and composed.

63
00:03:10,280 --> 00:03:13,330
Thanks to Misugi-kun's wonderful directions...

64
00:03:13,330 --> 00:03:15,420
...there's no opening in Musashi's defense!

65
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:17,840
That's it! This match is ours!

66
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,490
Nankatsu is in a difficult situation.

67
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:22,260
They can't mount a proper attack in this state.

68
00:03:22,260 --> 00:03:25,340
Less than a minute left!

69
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:28,590
They're slowing down! Here's a chance for us!

70
00:03:28,590 --> 00:03:30,100
Go and get the ball!

71
00:03:30,100 --> 00:03:33,640
If we get the ball and keep it here, we win the match!

72
00:03:33,640 --> 00:03:34,560
Yes!

73
00:03:34,560 --> 00:03:37,840
Now Musashi is putting on heavy pressure to steal the ball!

74
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:41,400
Nankatsu is fighting with everything they have not to give up the ball!

75
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,560
Not working.

76
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,280
At this rate, time will run out!

77
00:03:44,280 --> 00:03:45,640
Got it!

78
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:48,660
What?! Is Nankatsu panicking?!

79
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:51,450
Musashi finally gets the ball!

80
00:03:51,450 --> 00:03:53,040
I won't allow it!

81
00:03:53,700 --> 00:03:57,130
Ishizaki-kun from Nankatsu immediately takes the ball back!

82
00:03:57,130 --> 00:03:58,750
You're the man, Ishizaki-kun!

83
00:03:58,750 --> 00:04:00,050
Let's go, everyone!

84
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:03,760
They seize an attack chance as the match nears its end!

85
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:09,310
However, Nankatsu's star player Tsubasa-kun is still tightly marked!

86
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:10,510
Kids...

87
00:04:10,510 --> 00:04:11,770
Time...

88
00:04:13,060 --> 00:04:15,390
Can't you do something about that marking?!

89
00:04:15,930 --> 00:04:17,520
Is Taki-kun going to shoot from here?!

90
00:04:19,520 --> 00:04:21,830
He's not! He's making a back pass!

91
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:23,360
It comes to Misaki-kun.

92
00:04:23,850 --> 00:04:25,740
We can't lose yet!

93
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:31,910
It's still too early for this to be my last match with everyone!

94
00:04:31,910 --> 00:04:33,040
Misaki-kun!

95
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:38,080
As expected, Nankatsu's second key player, refusing to give up until the final second...

96
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:40,000
...is Misaki-kun!

97
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:44,010
Stop him! Stop his dribble with all your strength!

98
00:04:44,010 --> 00:04:46,510
If you succeed, victory will be ours!

99
00:04:46,510 --> 00:04:47,920
Alright, let's stop him!

100
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,760
We can't let him advance any further!

101
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:50,900
No way.

102
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:54,640
Even if the others follow me, Tsubasa-kun is still marked.

103
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:57,520
Is this as far as it all goes?

104
00:04:57,520 --> 00:05:00,270
Misaki! Shoot with all your might!

105
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:01,940
Wakabayashi-kun!

106
00:05:01,940 --> 00:05:03,260
That's right, Misaki-kun!

107
00:05:03,260 --> 00:05:04,940
It's impossible for me to pass to you.

108
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:06,650
Shoot!

109
00:05:07,820 --> 00:05:10,830
Alright! All or nothing!

110
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:13,120
I'll handle this somehow!

111
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,840
Goalkeeper, jump to the right!

112
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,450
Okay!

113
00:05:15,450 --> 00:05:19,000
Misaki-kun strikes with all his power, aiming for the goal!

114
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:22,750
H-He blocked it!

115
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:26,630
Is this the moment Musashi's victory is decided?!

116
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:29,840
Not yet! The referee hasn't blown the whistle!

117
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:33,560
How can you expect me to give up until the very last moment of the match?!

118
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,560
Tsubasa-kun!

119
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,330
Nankatsu gets the ball again!

120
00:05:37,330 --> 00:05:40,100
Nankatsu's last chance hasn't slipped away yet!

121
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:44,110
Tsubasa-kun is someone who can shoot from tight angles!

122
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:46,280
Block all shooting paths!

123
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:46,860
Okay!

124
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:47,780
Damn it!

125
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:51,530
Tsubasa-kun can't shoot like this!

126
00:05:51,530 --> 00:05:56,100
Completely surrounded, Tsubasa-kun can't even pass.

127
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:57,460
And there's no time left either!

128
00:05:58,790 --> 00:05:59,540
Tsubasa!

129
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:00,540
Tsubasa-kun!

130
00:06:00,540 --> 00:06:01,130
Tsubasa-kun!

131
00:06:01,130 --> 00:06:02,040
Tsubasa!

132
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:04,420
Don't let him get the ball out of there!

133
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:06,240
I can't give up.

134
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,130
It's too early to say it's over.

135
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:10,760
There has to be a chance.

136
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:12,640
There has to be a way...

137
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:13,900
I'm sure of it!

138
00:06:16,930 --> 00:06:19,440
There's only one way out of this cage.

139
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:21,580
And it's right here!

140
00:06:21,580 --> 00:06:22,240
What?!

141
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:26,780
Tsubasa-kun flicks the ball up!

142
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:30,450
Tsubasa-kun jumps up with the ball.

143
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,260
There!

144
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:41,710
Tsubasa-kun performs an overhead kick in the final moments of the match!

145
00:06:41,710 --> 00:06:43,960
T-Tsubasa-kun!

146
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,260
That's to be expected from Tsubasa-kun.

147
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:48,710
You're an amazing player, even when cornered.

148
00:06:48,710 --> 00:06:51,970
But this isn't an angle you can shoot from.

149
00:06:51,970 --> 00:06:54,180
It's too tight.

150
00:06:54,180 --> 00:06:56,810
Musashi will truly be the winner.

151
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,770
That's it!

152
00:07:02,770 --> 00:07:03,400
We did it!

153
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:08,400
Misaki-kun goes into the goal with the ball! What an amazing header this kid just made!

154
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,680
Equalizer!

155
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:14,490
Nankatsu ties it up 4-4 at the very last moment!

156
00:07:14,490 --> 00:07:17,190
I did it!

157
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:18,980
Misaki-kun must be really happy.

158
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:23,360
He scored an amazing goal when they were about to lose.

159
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,900
Misaki-kun, thank you.

160
00:07:25,900 --> 00:07:27,670
You really scored beautifully.

161
00:07:27,670 --> 00:07:28,980
We did it! We did it!

162
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,420
You did it, Misaki!

163
00:07:31,300 --> 00:07:32,800
Tsubasa!

164
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,800
Tsubasa... Misaki...

165
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,300
Equalizer!

166
00:07:36,300 --> 00:07:37,890
Amazing, Misaki!

167
00:07:37,890 --> 00:07:39,560
The greatest Nankatsu!

168
00:07:40,570 --> 00:07:41,600
Damn it!

169
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:44,060
We were just one step away from victory.

170
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:48,770
The real key player was indeed Misaki-kun.

171
00:07:48,770 --> 00:07:52,930
And that last overhead kick Tsubasa-kun made...

172
00:07:52,930 --> 00:07:56,030
...was a pass rather than a shot.

173
00:07:56,920 --> 00:08:00,390
I misread the game at the very last moment.

174
00:08:00,390 --> 00:08:03,320
I'm still too inexperienced.

175
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:06,080
Football is truly difficult.

176
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:11,430
There's no time left on the clock, and we've entered injury time.

177
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:13,430
The match will continue with Musashi's kick-off.

178
00:08:16,970 --> 00:08:18,220
Will it end in a draw?

179
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:20,470
Will we go to penalties?

180
00:08:20,470 --> 00:08:21,450
Not yet!

181
00:08:21,450 --> 00:08:24,100
Don't think the match is over yet!

182
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:27,900
Until the referee blows his whistle, until the very last moment...

183
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,650
...I'll give it everything I have!

184
00:08:29,650 --> 00:08:30,900
Tsubasa-kun...

185
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:34,150
Tsubasa-kun hasn't given up on the match yet!

186
00:08:34,150 --> 00:08:36,740
Tsubasa-kun, you...

187
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:39,490
This is the last match Misugi-kun will play.

188
00:08:39,490 --> 00:08:43,050
Even though Misugi-kun is behind with his heart condition...

189
00:08:43,050 --> 00:08:45,620
...he pushed his own limits.

190
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:52,130
In response to Misugi-kun, I can't waste even a single second of this match!

191
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:55,130
Captain! He's going to shoot!

192
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:56,940
I'll stop it!

193
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:59,140
I'll stop this shot!

194
00:08:59,140 --> 00:09:00,890
Let's go, Misugi-kun!

195
00:09:07,980 --> 00:09:11,440
Tsubasa-kun takes a very long-range shot!

196
00:09:13,050 --> 00:09:16,900
Go! On this wet ground, the ball will travel faster than usual!

197
00:09:16,900 --> 00:09:19,780
It's one of the hardest shots for a goalkeeper to save!

198
00:09:19,780 --> 00:09:22,330
Tazawa-kun can't reach it!

199
00:09:22,330 --> 00:09:24,500
But Misugi-kun is coming!

200
00:09:27,230 --> 00:09:29,750
Misugi-kun is delayed for a moment!

201
00:09:29,750 --> 00:09:31,750
And at the same time, the referee blows his whistle.

202
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:33,790
What happened?

203
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:37,170
Is it a goal, or the end of the match?

204
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:56,900
Goal!

205
00:09:56,900 --> 00:09:59,110
The match ends with the goal!

206
00:09:59,800 --> 00:10:04,870
Shizuoka representative Nankatsu SC wins 5-4!

207
00:10:04,870 --> 00:10:06,690
It's a miracle!

208
00:10:06,690 --> 00:10:09,420
Such a comeback couldn't have been expected until the very last moment!

209
00:10:09,420 --> 00:10:15,050
The miracle happened thanks to Tsubasa-kun's never-giving-up, determined will!

210
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:18,230
I won...

211
00:10:18,230 --> 00:10:19,860
Did I win?

212
00:10:19,860 --> 00:10:22,300
You did it! You did it, Tsubasa!

213
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:29,570
Captain!

214
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:34,130
I'm fine, manager.

215
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:36,190
Misugi-kun!

216
00:10:37,190 --> 00:10:39,870
Congratulations, Tsubasa-kun.

217
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:41,950
You were truly amazing.

218
00:10:41,950 --> 00:10:44,950
You won our battle.

219
00:10:44,950 --> 00:10:47,700
That's not true, Misugi-kun.

220
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:53,330
Without the obstacle caused by the trouble in your body, you would definitely have stopped my last shot...

221
00:10:53,330 --> 00:10:56,890
...and Musashi would have won this match.

222
00:10:56,890 --> 00:10:59,000
Thank you, Tsubasa-kun.

223
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,900
But it's okay.

224
00:11:01,910 --> 00:11:05,350
I am satisfied with all my heart.

225
00:11:05,350 --> 00:11:07,100
Misugi-kun...

226
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:10,800
I had always played only a few minutes in matches.

227
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:15,860
But thanks to you being my opponent, I was able to play the entire time today.

228
00:11:15,860 --> 00:11:22,620
Playing such a wonderful match with you until the very end, compared to fighting against you...

229
00:11:22,620 --> 00:11:24,870
...made me very happy.

230
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:27,870
Thank you, Tsubasa-kun.

231
00:11:27,870 --> 00:11:29,870
Thank you, everyone.

232
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:30,900
Captain...

233
00:11:30,900 --> 00:11:32,370
Misugi-san...

234
00:11:32,370 --> 00:11:37,000
Manager, I'm sorry, but can I borrow your shoulder for a bit?

235
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:43,130
Today's match wouldn't have been this wonderful without you.

236
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:45,640
Captain...

237
00:11:45,640 --> 00:11:48,440
Thank you for everything you've done so far.

238
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:52,560
This is your last duty as manager of Musashi FC.

239
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:54,820
Please help me to the bench.

240
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,550
Okay!

241
00:11:58,730 --> 00:12:00,190
Misugi-san...

242
00:12:00,190 --> 00:12:03,280
My love, Jun did a really great job.

243
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,060
He really did a great job.

244
00:12:05,060 --> 00:12:06,700
Y-Yes.

245
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:09,950
Tsubasa-kun.

246
00:12:10,950 --> 00:12:13,960
In the end, I won't stop playing football.

247
00:12:16,210 --> 00:12:19,640
Even if I can only play for 1 or 2 minutes...

248
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:22,380
...I will definitely stand on the field.

249
00:12:22,380 --> 00:12:26,340
And one day, I'll overcome this heart condition of mine.

250
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:28,340
Misugi-kun...

251
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:43,090
# Nankatsu SC: 5
Musashi FC: 4 #

252
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:52,350
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

253
00:12:56,420 --> 00:13:01,300
Captain, today is the day of Tsubasa-kun's final match, isn't it?

254
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:05,300
Yes. It's really a shame I can't watch it from Japan.

255
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:07,800
We're rooting for him too.

256
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:10,550
Please watch it from here when the match starts.

257
00:13:10,550 --> 00:13:13,200
Please leave the rest to us.

258
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,910
That won't do.

259
00:13:16,720 --> 00:13:19,310
Do your best, Tsubasa.

260
00:13:26,940 --> 00:13:29,030
What's taking that old man so long?

261
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:32,200
Seriously. What is he even doing?

262
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,390
What?

263
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:38,280
They're here!

264
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,380
They really are!

265
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:41,880
# Certain Victory! Nankatsu #

266
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,630
Amazing!

267
00:13:47,130 --> 00:13:49,260
Sorry for making you wait.

268
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:50,640
Everyone, hop on.

269
00:13:52,500 --> 00:13:55,320
Mister, thank you for coming and taking us every day.

270
00:13:55,320 --> 00:13:58,140
What? I have work at the same hour anyway.

271
00:13:58,140 --> 00:14:00,980
But Nankatsu is really strong, huh.

272
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:03,400
They're worth supporting.

273
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:06,110
Of course, because Tsubasa-kun is playing!

274
00:14:06,110 --> 00:14:08,200
Yeah, yeah. It's Tsubasa-kun, right?

275
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:10,360
Your boyfriend, I guess.

276
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:10,930
What?

277
00:14:10,930 --> 00:14:13,490
What are you saying, mister?!

278
00:14:13,490 --> 00:14:16,330
Hey! Don't hit me while I'm driving!

279
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:19,580
Everyone, you've done a great job up to today.

280
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:23,920
We've been through a lot in this process.

281
00:14:23,920 --> 00:14:26,460
Nishio left us because he got injured.

282
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:28,920
I'm sorry for making you worry, kids.

283
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:32,140
You worked really hard to fill his place, Ishizaki.

284
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:41,030
Speaking of filling gaps, Morisaki, who replaced Wakabayashi, did a wonderful job.

285
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:42,020
Thank you.

286
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:46,180
The one protecting Nankatsu's goal today will be Wakabayashi.

287
00:14:46,180 --> 00:14:48,030
Thank you, Morisaki.

288
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:50,530
I'm the one who should thank you, Wakabayashi-san.

289
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:55,280
I won't let Meiwa score even one goal against the Nankatsu goal you've protected until now.

290
00:14:56,540 --> 00:15:00,630
But if something goes wrong with Wakabayashi's leg...

291
00:15:00,630 --> 00:15:02,860
...you'll have to go in immediately, Morisaki.

292
00:15:02,860 --> 00:15:05,700
Okay. I've finished my preparations.

293
00:15:05,700 --> 00:15:08,050
And our captain, Tsubasa.

294
00:15:08,050 --> 00:15:09,170
Yes.

295
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:12,890
You've led the team wonderfully so far.

296
00:15:12,890 --> 00:15:20,620
And the rest of you too. Each and every one of you truly gave it your all.

297
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:26,110
But this will be the last match you play together.

298
00:15:26,110 --> 00:15:30,470
Misaki will move somewhere else again after this match.

299
00:15:31,360 --> 00:15:37,330
And it looks like Tsubasa will go to Brazil if he becomes champion.

300
00:15:37,330 --> 00:15:38,700
Yes.

301
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:40,900
Listen, kids.

302
00:15:40,900 --> 00:15:46,140
Fight in the finals giving it everything you have so you won't have any regrets later!

303
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:47,090
Yes!

304
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:59,660
The grand final of the National Youth Football Tournament. Those who have managed to come this far...

305
00:15:59,660 --> 00:16:05,520
...are Saitama representative Meiwa FC and Shizuoka representative Nankatsu SC.

306
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:08,520
This year's elementary school students are very passionate.

307
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:13,530
The stadium is overflowing with spectators who want to watch the match!

308
00:16:23,540 --> 00:16:27,080
First, the Nankatsu SC players enter the field.

309
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:29,990
Nankatsu! Push!

310
00:16:29,990 --> 00:16:30,920
Yes!

311
00:16:30,920 --> 00:16:32,760
Everyone, do your best!

312
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:34,430
Definitely win!

313
00:16:34,430 --> 00:16:36,500
These are my mom and the others!

314
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:37,550
Dad!

315
00:16:37,550 --> 00:16:41,430
Ryo! I closed the bathhouse to come today!

316
00:16:41,430 --> 00:16:44,810
Don't make mistakes and become a burden to others!

317
00:16:44,810 --> 00:16:50,550
Come on... If you're going to cheer, couldn't you find something better to say?

318
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,820
D-Dad...

319
00:16:53,820 --> 00:16:59,330
This is your last match with everyone. Do your best, Taro.

320
00:16:59,330 --> 00:17:03,330
My dad came! Dad!

321
00:17:07,330 --> 00:17:08,830
Roberto!

322
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:12,340
You've finally reached the finals.

323
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:14,820
I'll win, Roberto.

324
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:17,640
I'll win, and we'll go to Brazil together.

325
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:22,400
Nankatsu immediately started their shooting warm-ups, but...

326
00:17:22,400 --> 00:17:23,810
...did something happen?

327
00:17:24,500 --> 00:17:28,600
The Meiwa players haven't come out onto the field yet.

328
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:30,240
They're late.

329
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:31,110
Could it be...

330
00:17:34,070 --> 00:17:37,250
Because of yesterday's match, Hyuga-kun...

331
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,740
What?!

332
00:17:47,550 --> 00:17:49,080
They're here!

333
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:51,250
Meiwa FC is here!

334
00:17:51,250 --> 00:17:55,710
Finally, I'll make you pay for this, Hyuga Kojiro.

335
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:58,930
Alright, time to fight, Hyuga-kun!

336
00:17:58,930 --> 00:18:02,430
Hyuga-san, we'll definitely win this match.

337
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:07,440
Yes, just as you said.

338
00:18:08,430 --> 00:18:10,750
Coach, how is the Captain's condition?!

339
00:18:10,750 --> 00:18:12,570
Can he play in the match?!

340
00:18:12,570 --> 00:18:14,920
Come on. Be quiet a bit.

341
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:17,980
Kojiro hasn't woken up yet.

342
00:18:17,980 --> 00:18:18,780
Still?

343
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:21,180
Then in today's match...

344
00:18:21,180 --> 00:18:23,520
Doctor, how is his condition?

345
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:28,060
His fever has gone down, but allowing him to play in the match after he wakes up...

346
00:18:28,060 --> 00:18:30,620
That's not a funny joke, doctor.

347
00:18:31,230 --> 00:18:32,380
Captain!

348
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:33,670
Hyuga-san!

349
00:18:33,670 --> 00:18:36,630
My body has already returned to normal.

350
00:18:36,630 --> 00:18:39,280
I made you all very worried.

351
00:18:39,280 --> 00:18:42,390
Did you think I would skip this match?

352
00:18:42,390 --> 00:18:44,000
Kojiro...

353
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:46,390
Are you really okay?

354
00:18:46,390 --> 00:18:48,610
I'm fine.

355
00:18:48,610 --> 00:18:52,150
I've made it this far thanks to you all.

356
00:18:52,150 --> 00:18:57,350
Until now, I thought teamwork in football was unnecessary.

357
00:18:57,350 --> 00:19:02,360
But I thought about it carefully and realized I can't play football alone.

358
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:08,870
If it weren't for Wakashimazu, we probably would have lost yesterday's match.

359
00:19:08,870 --> 00:19:13,880
And we won the matches so far with the help of your strength too.

360
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:20,130
Teamwork, which means trusting your teammates, is somewhat important.

361
00:19:20,130 --> 00:19:21,470
Hyuga-san!

362
00:19:21,470 --> 00:19:24,860
I want to win today's match at all costs!

363
00:19:24,860 --> 00:19:27,620
Support me with your strength once more!

364
00:19:27,620 --> 00:19:29,430
Okay, Captain!

365
00:19:29,430 --> 00:19:31,730
I'm counting on you.

366
00:19:31,810 --> 00:19:35,780
Hyuga-san trusted his teammates for the first time.

367
00:19:35,780 --> 00:19:37,980
In response to that trust...

368
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:40,990
...we have no choice but to win this match.

369
00:19:42,260 --> 00:19:46,990
As I thought, Kojiro truly was a tiger sleeping for a while.

370
00:19:46,990 --> 00:19:53,950
After just one night's rest, the tiger has returned, having grown.

371
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:56,750
We'll do it. We'll win the finals.

372
00:19:59,260 --> 00:20:01,650
I'll definitely win!

373
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:07,960
Alright!

374
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:10,960
Let's go support our big brother Kojiro!

375
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:12,270
Yes!

376
00:20:12,270 --> 00:20:14,460
You forgot your hats.

377
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:16,400
It's going to be hot today.

378
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:19,120
Don't forget to drink plenty of fluids.

379
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:20,570
Okay!

380
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:26,450
I'll finally put an end to a life like this.

381
00:20:26,450 --> 00:20:30,700
Let's settle our score today, Nankatsu SC!

382
00:20:32,710 --> 00:20:35,830
As we thought, the final will be played between these two.

383
00:20:35,830 --> 00:20:37,320
Yes.

384
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:42,090
Based on the result of this match, I'll decide which one is worth recruiting.

385
00:20:46,090 --> 00:20:48,480
Alright, let's go!

386
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:51,020
Meiwa football does not accept defeat!

387
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:54,290
We'll win again today, and we'll be the champions!

388
00:20:54,290 --> 00:20:55,440
Yes!

389
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:58,570
Come on, everyone, this is the final match!

390
00:20:58,570 --> 00:21:01,140
Let's do our best and play without regrets!

391
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:04,070
And this time we'll crush Meiwa!

392
00:21:04,070 --> 00:21:06,320
Yes!

393
00:21:09,330 --> 00:21:12,660
Let's cheer with all our spirit one last time!

394
00:21:12,660 --> 00:21:16,960
Nankatsu! Avenge the first match!

395
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:19,090
Yes!

396
00:21:19,700 --> 00:21:25,420
By coincidence, the final match will be played between those who played the first match.

397
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:31,430
Meiwa won back then, but both teams were equal in talent.

398
00:21:31,430 --> 00:21:39,190
And it doesn't end there. Nankatsu's usual goalkeeper, Wakabayashi-kun, has returned for this match.

399
00:21:39,190 --> 00:21:44,440
Meiwa might not be able to score like they did in the first match.

400
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:49,950
However, in Meiwa's goal for this match is the mysterious goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun...

401
00:21:49,950 --> 00:21:54,340
...who entered mid-match and stopped Furano's penalty kick.

402
00:21:54,340 --> 00:21:58,210
They seem to have strengthened their defense even further.

403
00:21:58,210 --> 00:22:00,710
I'm counting on you, Wakashimazu.

404
00:22:01,350 --> 00:22:07,720
In the end, will Nankatsu or Meiwa be the team that rises above all the others in the country?

405
00:22:08,500 --> 00:22:14,720
The National Youth Football Tournament final begins now!

